      "text": "Today, the @USCGAcademy Class of 2026 joined the fleet as @POTUS  Donald J. Trump delivered the commencement address, with @DHSgov  @SecMullinDHS and Coast Guard Commandant Adm. Kevin Lunday marking the occasion in New London, Connecticut. \n\nThe Class of 2026 enters the Service at a defining moment. As the Coast Guard continues its historic transformation, our newest generation of Coast Guard officers will lead our operations to save lives, secure America’s maritime borders and approaches, facilitate commerce, and respond to crises. Semper Paratus! \n\n#USCG #SemperParatus #CoastGuardAcademy #USCGA2026\n@WhiteHouse",
