      "text": "We're investing in our people to ensure they are ready for our next-generation fleet.\n\nA new $17.7M contract will construct advanced training facilities at Training Center Yorktown, preparing our crews to operate new Offshore Patrol and Waterways Commerce Cutters. As @USCG continues our historic transformation, we’re maximizing our return on America’s investment and forging a more agile, capable, and responsive force.  \n\nRead more: https://t.co/dfk4MlWgL4\n\n#USCG",
      "text_resolved": "We're investing in our people to ensure they are ready for our next-generation fleet.\n\nA new $17.7M contract will construct advanced training facilities at Training Center Yorktown, preparing our crews to operate new Offshore Patrol and Waterways Commerce Cutters. As @USCG continues our historic transformation, we’re maximizing our return on America’s investment and forging a more agile, capable, and responsive force.  \n\nRead more: https://www.news.uscg.mil/Press-Releases/Article/4498116/coast-guard-awards-contract-for-advanced-training-facilities-to-support-future/\n\n#USCG",
