      "text": "Today on National Maritime Day, we honor the U.S. Merchant Marines and the critical role the maritime industry plays in our national defense and economy. As @USCG facilitates maritime commerce vital to economic prosperity and strategic mobility, our shared efforts throughout the Marine Transportation System drive the movement of over 1.8 billion tons of cargo and $5.4 trillion in goods annually. \n\n#NationalMaritimeDay #MaritimeSecurity @DHSgov",
