      "text": "This National Search and Rescue Week, we celebrate the steadfast dedication of @USCG men and women to our most sacred trust: saving lives. Last year, the Coast Guard saved 5,200+ lives and preserved $1B+ in property. From the tireless vigilance of our watchstanders, to our courageous crews on the front lines, to our vast network of local, state, tribal, and federal partners, the global SAR system stands ready 24/7 to answer the call. Thank you to the entire search and rescue community for your relentless commitment to bringing people home safely!   \n  #NationalSARWeek #USCG #SAR @DHSgov @USCGPACAREA @USCGLANTAREA",
