      "text": "Leading in crisis across the interagency – before disaster strikes. \n \nPreparation is key to responding in crisis. The U.S Coast Guard leads major exercises to prepare for catastrophic environmental events known as a Spill of National Significance. \n\nBy working alongside the Environmental Protection Agency, the private sector, and non-governmental organizations, we ensure that the National Response Framework is rigorously tested and ready to protect our nation’s ports, waterways, and communities. \n \n#USCG #Readiness #CrisisResponse @DHSgov @EPA",
